{"seq":3,"kind":"model.response","ts":"2026-09-21T14:40:04.906Z","payload":{"content":"A request to `GET /invoices/:id` throws a `TypeError` at `InvoiceMapper.toDto` after `repo.findById` resolves `null`, and the error is raised while reading `invoice.currency` on a missing row. The most likely cause is a missing not-found guard between the repository lookup and the mapper, so the 404 path never runs.","tool_calls":[],"usage":{"in":318,"out":72}},"prev_hash":"be8f7e79aeb1f5e29d7b16f7f3e6d6f4ef4b7c64f99f6375189b20960291e4ec","hash":"9fab5d79d9d86bd5c6fcf45eab2c6cb2773cf28682907d46fb801d7bfa3aee07"}
